          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.366,
            0.633,
            0.385
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Let the number of toys produced on that day be x."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.391,
            0.858,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, the cost of production (in rupees) of each toy that day = 55 – x So, the total cost of production (in rupees) that day "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x \\left( 55 - x \\right)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.441,
            0.257,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.441,
            0.537,
            0.461
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_2_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "x \\left( 55 - x \\right) = 750"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.467,
            0.19,
            0.485
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "i.e.,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
